  "description": "Esika endured life with her in-laws, relying solely on love.\nHowever, as her husband commits adultery with his friend and suffers a major accident, she recalls memories of her past life.\n\nShe discovers that she was none other than the villainess Cheon Yeong-ryeong, and that this place is a world inside a book.\n\nRecalling her past life and the ill-fated ties she shared with those who tormented her, Esika eventually vows revenge against the Duke's family.\n\n_Source: Naver Series, translated_",
